Which directory did you unpack Stan into?  It looks like
this problem can creep in through template matching if
the path contains a colon (I didn't even know that was
legal in a file name).  For instance, it seems a common problem
on Cygwin for Windows when using absolute Windows path names with
colons in them.

Also, which version of make are you using?  I get:

   $ make -v
   GNU Make 3.81
   Copyright (C) 2006  Free Software Foundation, Inc.
   This is free software; see the source for copying conditions.
   There is NO warranty; not even for MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A
   PARTICULAR PURPOSE.

   This program built for i386-apple-darwin11.3.0

For what it's worth, nobody else has ever reported a problem like
this :-)

- Bob

