Subject: Re: [stan-users] Integer floor calculation or type casting
Message-ID: <uqh1h158ntg.9OuqleaJ_u4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <uqh1h158ntg.17AT0F60vTMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
