>>> Firstly, initialization in Stan is done in the unconstrained scale,
>>> so init=0 does not correspond to sigma=0 but
>>> rather sigma=0.
> >
>> I'm guessing the last sigma=0 should be sigma=1, going from an
>> unconstrained to a constrained scale via exp.
